# Deep modules

Put Box HTTP, Cache Components directives, and AI Gateway calls behind small interfaces. Callers should not import the Box SDK in page files.

Preferred seams (same as `CONTEXT.md`): `canAccess`, `getDocument`, webhook verify+revalidate, ask tools.

Accept Box and cache as injected adapters. Pages compose; they do not open sockets. If a function is a pass-through, delete it rather than keep a shallow wrapper.

UI copy: short, specific, no filler. No “welcome to your journey” or empty section labels.
